(29, 24, NULL, 'MI In Ear Headphones Basic - Black - PN10398', 'mi-in-ear-headphones-basic-black-pn10398', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'physical', 'With an aluminum alloy sound chamber and aerospace-grade metal drivers, Xiaomi Mi In-Ear Headphones Basic provide direct audio through a 3.5mm jack. Connection happens at a 32 Ω impedance level for compatibility with most mobile devices and laptops. This updated model incorporates a 3rd generation balanced damping system and transitions to a tangle-resistant flat cable design.Key Features3rd Gen Balanced Damping: Dual-channel airflow design balances internal pressure. Stops the muffled sensation...', 'With an aluminum alloy sound chamber and aerospace-grade metal drivers, Xiaomi Mi In-Ear Headphones Basic provide direct audio through a 3.5mm jack. Connection happens at a 32 Ω impedance level for compatibility with most mobile devices and laptops. This updated model incorporates a 3rd generation balanced damping system and transitions to a tangle-resistant flat cable design.Key Features3rd Gen Balanced Damping: Dual-channel airflow design balances internal pressure. Stops the muffled sensation common in sealed in-ear designs.Anodized Aluminum Chamber: CNC milling shapes the corrosion-resistant metal housing. Blocks external resonance and prevents sound leakage at high volumes.Kevlar Reinforced Cable: Flat TPE exterior covers an internal fiber core. Resists tangling and survives heavy sweat and humidity.In-line Microphone: A single-button remote sits on the cable. Captures voice clearly for hands-free calls on Android and iOS.Frequently Asked QuestionsDoes Mi In-Ear Headphones Basic have volume control?The remote includes one button for playback and calls but lacks volume adjustment. Change the sound level directly from the phone or laptop hardware.Is Mi Basic earphone good for gaming?A wired 3.5mm connection maintains zero-latency audio for real-time gaming feedback. The 32 Ω impedance matches standard mobile output without needing extra power.How can I identify the original Xiaomi Mi In-Ear Headphones Basic?Genuine units use a CNC-milled aluminum alloy chamber and flat TPE cables. Counterfeit versions typically feature plastic housings and standard round wires.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'published', '2026-08-29 15:39:47', '2026-08-29 15:39:47', NULL, 0),
(30, 24, NULL, 'OnePlus Bullets 3.5mm Jack V2 Earphones - Black', 'oneplus-bullets-35mm-jack-v2-earphones-black', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'physical', 'OnePlus Bullets 3.5mm Jack V2 Earphones - BlackIt\'s just so engaging that audiophiles are going to love spending their time with the OnePlus Bullets V2 Earphones. For natural sound reproduction, these earphones offer a frequency response from 20 to 20,000 Hz, allowing listeners to appreciate the most minute details in their favorite tracks. The lightweight 14-gram in-ear chamber allows for comfortable extended listening. Although the addition of 9 mm dynamic drivers can make for a rich auditory...', 'OnePlus Bullets 3.5mm Jack V2 Earphones - BlackIt\'s just so engaging that audiophiles are going to love spending their time with the OnePlus Bullets V2 Earphones. For natural sound reproduction, these earphones offer a frequency response from 20 to 20,000 Hz, allowing listeners to appreciate the most minute details in their favorite tracks. The lightweight 14-gram in-ear chamber allows for comfortable extended listening. Although the addition of 9 mm dynamic drivers can make for a rich auditory experience, it provides punchy bass and crystal-clear highs that make every note sound beautiful.User-Friendly Features for Everyday ConvenienceThese earphones were designed with practicality in mind. The 1.2-meter length of the cable allows enough room to maneuver it even when connected to either a smartphone or laptop. A 3.5mm jack provides broad compatibility with a wide range of devices. At the same time, the volume control key ensures sound-level adjustments are as easy as possible for users. It also allows voice calls via the earphones themselves, adding a layer of versatility to daily use. Magnetic, the earphones will remain tangle-free when not in use-further convenience for those on the go.Durability Meets Quality in DesignThe OnePlus Bullets V2 are durable, considering they are manufactured from quality materials. The coil consists of copper-clad aluminum, and the core is made of enameled copper wire for better performance, making it long-lasting. The diaphragm is made of Aryphan polyacrylate, which ensures good sound quality without compromising on light weight. Not waterproof but strong enough to bear daily wear and tear, this very pair is what one is looking for reliable performance without compromising on style needs.Price and Availability in BangladeshOnePlus Bullets V2 Earphones strike a beautiful price in Bangladesh. This allowed budget-sensitive consumers to access high-quality audio. With a three-month warranty, users can be confident in their purchase, which only speaks to the quality of OnePlus\' commitment. Their reasonable pricing combined with superior sound quality makes the Bullets V2 an excellent choice for just about anyone looking to invest in a pair of reliable earphones. They come in sleek black, effortlessly complementing any device or style. For this reason, they are a must-have for any music lover in the region.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'published', '2026-08-29 15:45:03', '2026-08-29 15:45:03', NULL, 0),
(31, 24, NULL, 'OnePlus Nord Wired Earphones - Black - E103A', 'oneplus-nord-wired-earphones-black-e103a', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'physical', 'Product Deion:  The OnePlus E103A Nord Wired Earphones in sleek black are designed to elevate your audio experience, and we\'re here to tell you why they\'re a fantastic choice. With OnePlus E103A Nord Magnetic Control Wired Earphone, these earphones deliver an audio quality that\'s hard to beat. You will be able to catch every high and low note because of the frequency response of 20 Hz to 20,000 Hz.   OnePlus Nord Earphone - Wired for Your Convenience The OnePlus Nord E103A is a 3.5 MM wired earp...', 'Product Deion:  The OnePlus E103A Nord Wired Earphones in sleek black are designed to elevate your audio experience, and we\'re here to tell you why they\'re a fantastic choice. With OnePlus E103A Nord Magnetic Control Wired Earphone, these earphones deliver an audio quality that\'s hard to beat. You will be able to catch every high and low note because of the frequency response of 20 Hz to 20,000 Hz.   OnePlus Nord Earphone - Wired for Your Convenience The OnePlus Nord E103A is a 3.5 MM wired earphone, ensuring that you never have to worry about running out of battery. What\'s more, this wired earphone comes with an inline mic and button controls, putting you in complete control of your calls and media playback. And if you\'re a fan of voice assistants, these earphones have you covered. Here\'s where the OnePlus E103A Nord truly stands out. These earphones are not just about sound; they\'re about convenience. They feature magnets that stick together, making them incredibly portable. But that\'s not all – these magnets double as audio controls. Unclip them to play your music and clip them back together to pause it. It\'s as simple as that.  We understand the importance of durability, which is why the OnePlus E103A Nord Magnetic Control Wired Earphone comes with an IPX4 waterproof rating, ensuring they can withstand splashes and the occasional rain shower. Plus, they come with a 6-month warranty for peace of mind.   OnePlus Nord Earphone Price in Bangladesh - Get Yours Today For those in Bangladesh looking for the OnePlus Nord Earphones, the OnePlus E103A Nord Wired Earphones are the perfect choice. Take advantage of the opportunity to experience top-tier sound quality, magnetic control, and IPX4 waterproofing. And the best part? They\'re available at a competitive price. Experience superior audio with the OnePlus Nord E103A Wired Earphones. OnePlus E103A Nord price in bd. Get yours now and elevate your listening experience today!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'published', '2026-08-29 15:46:43', '2026-08-29 15:46:43', NULL, 0),
(32, 24, NULL, 'Xiaomi Capsule In-ear Headphones - Space Gray', 'xiaomi-capsule-in-ear-headphones-space-gray', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'physical', 'Xiaomi Capsule In-ear Headphones - Space GrayXiaomi Capsule In-ear Headphones are great for music lovers. These headphones deliver clear sound and deep bass. They fit comfortably in your ears. You can use them for hours without discomfort. The design looks sleek and modern. It is perfect for daily use. These headphones feature smart control for easy operation. You can adjust the volume quickly. The lightweight design makes them easy to carry. You will enjoy using them on the go.Smart Control Fea...', 'Xiaomi Capsule In-ear Headphones - Space GrayXiaomi Capsule In-ear Headphones are great for music lovers. These headphones deliver clear sound and deep bass. They fit comfortably in your ears. You can use them for hours without discomfort. The design looks sleek and modern. It is perfect for daily use. These headphones feature smart control for easy operation. You can adjust the volume quickly. The lightweight design makes them easy to carry. You will enjoy using them on the go.Smart Control FeaturesXiaomi Capsule Headphones have smart control features. You can control your music with ease. The headphones support voice calls clearly. You can talk to your friends without issues. They connect easily with your devices. The wired connection ensures stable sound quality. You will experience no delays while listening.Water Resistance and Noise FiltrationXiaomi Capsule Earbuds come with water resistance. You can use them while exercising or in the rain. They will stay safe and protected. This headphones provide noise filtration benefits. You can enjoy your music without distractions. The design blocks out unwanted sounds. You will focus on your favorite songs. These features make them ideal for busy environments.Xiaomi Capsule In-ear Headphones - Space Gray Price in BDXiaomi In-ear Headphones have a great value. The price in Bangladesh 